  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring and Evaluations for Policymaking</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the IDF is to build the institutional and human  resources capacity in the Center of Government (General Secretariat of the Government)to monitor and evaluate public policies. The project has two main components. Under the first coomponent, a monitoring and evaluation system will be developed at the General Secretariat of the Government to better articulate linkages between stragegic planning, sectoral policies and the available budget resources. Under the second component,capacity building for monitoring and evaluation in the Center of Government and line ministries is built, through modular training programs and knowledge transfers. TF098645 The objective of the IDF is to build the institutional and human resources capacity of the Center of Government (General Secretariat of the Government) to monitor and evaluate public policies.</narrative>
  </description>
